WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.710
A camper lights a gas
heater inside a closed tent.

2
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:08.370
The tent warms up nicely, and there's
still plenty of fuel left in the cylinder.

3
00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:13.650
But as the oxygen runs low, the
air in the tent becomes deadly.

4
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.570
Why can a heater burning in a closed
tent kill, even with fuel to spare?

5
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:22.540
In this mission, you'll write
balanced equations for burning metals,

6
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.290
non-metals, hydrocarbons and alcohols.

7
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.850
You'll find out what changes
when there isn't enough oxygen,

8
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.170
and why some flames burn yellow and smoky.

9
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:36.520
Your mission: explain why a
heater in a closed tent can kill.
